  "title": "S'mores Brownies",
  "description": "Make s'mores brownies by topping a batch of your favorite brownies (any flavor!) with campfire favorites: graham crackers, chocolate, and marshmallows.",
  "authors": [
    "LIZALOUISE"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-07-13T20:07:03-04:00",
