  "ingredients": [
    "1 (18.3 ounce) package fudge brownie mix (such as Betty Crocker®)",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "2 large eggs",
    "3 tablespoons water",
    "6 graham crackers",
    "1.5 cups miniature marshmallows",
    "8 (1.5 ounce) bars milk chocolate, coarsely chopped"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PqfVUtvglH892jhKF0_sUYHr8XM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-19848-smore-brownies-VAT-step-01-862e2060f1894ba5a7cb522a3afe06c1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19848/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the brownies: Stir brownie mix, oil, eggs, and water together in a medium bowl until well blended. Pour batter into the prepared pan. Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bWZ-HZlHDmCZSbU8RS-1DaPi4uU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-19848-smore-brownies-VAT-step-02-A-a1a72050b4204ae8b041a727f772e282.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19848/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the brownies are baking, make the topping: Break graham crackers into 1-inch pieces and place into a bowl. Add marshmallows and chopped chocolate and toss to combine.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/evH-bLryMfG--mMdlWUm1xEvHWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-19848-smore-brownies-VAT-step-03-400002cb3ffd492b9eaa2d661b6e265f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19848/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove brownies from the oven and sprinkle with topping ingredients. Return to the oven and continue to bake until a toothpick inserted 2 inches from the side of the pan comes out clean, 7 to 10 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RvxC3G5bqiuoHIegB3noPItsxwg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-19848-smore-brownies-VAT-step-04-A-b34246eed3e54ef2aaabbc8647115308.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19848/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice, serve, and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ap_-DVDkjpzLDlF37Rj5P3z9e24=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-19848-smore-brownies-VAT-4x3-A-514c25eb7df5496a9fb304093bab930d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19848/step_05.webp"
    }
