    "description": "In this video, Nicole shows you how to make a s’mores brownie. This decadent recipe substitutes the usual chocolate bar of a s’more with a rich chocolate brownie. After layering a baking dish with graham crackers, pour the brownie mix over the crackers and bake the brownies in the oven. Once baked, coat the brownies in chopped chocolate and a layer of marshmallows before allowing the dish to bake again. With gooey melted marshmallows and an explosion of chocolate flavor, there’s not a better summertime dessert.",
